                                "sense_id": "7f13c161-53ac-3f1f-bc46-5d7808425222",
                                "text": "Nor was this strong geographical position her [Florence's] only bulwark; the capital itself in those unskilful days of obsidional tactics was deemed impregnable except through famine."
